<https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Procedural Operation Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che descrive le operazioni procedurali applicate per generare il testo vincolato. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:involvesOperation."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
